MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Richard Kaysen, and City Council
FROM:

Sara Vasquez, Asst. Director of Purchasing
DATE:

July 21, 2014
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #R-4-15, for furnishing One New 2014-2015 Twin Screw
Diesel-Powered Cab & Chassis for the City’s Sanitation Division.
______________________________________________
We had two (2) bidders respond to this bid, and the bid tab is attached.
Bidder
Make/Model/Year
Total Price
Delivery
Peterbilt of Wyoming
Cheyenne, WY
2015-2016 Peterbilt Model 365
$138,873.00
150-180 days ARO
Peterbilt of Wyoming
Cheyenne, WY
New 2014 Peterbilt Model 384
$129,959.00
45 days ARO
Floyd’s Truck Center
2015 Freightliner 114 SD Tractor
$127,023.00
120-150 days ARO

The bids were reviewed by Dennis Bell and Jim Elias, and their recommendation is to go with
Peterbilt of Wyoming for the 2015-2016 Peterbilt Model 365 in the amount of $138,873.00.

This is the only bid that met all specifications.

There is no trade-in on this vehicle.  This is to replace the semi that was heavily damaged due to
a fire.

Funding:
210-21-2111-40-85450 (Insurance & Misc. Claims)
